S)</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Exam Conduct </strong>: Bhupendra Narayan Mandal University (BNMU), Bihar</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BNMU University UG Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7176%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Course </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2824%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility </strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 28.7176%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">B.A/ B.Sc/ B.Com</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 71.2824%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed the <strong>Intermediate examination</strong> (I.A./I.Sc./I.Com or 10+2) from the <strong>Bihar School Examination Board or any equivalent</strong> examination recognized by other approved National or State Boards.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BNMU University UG Admission 1st Merit List 2026-30</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to download their 1st Merit List candidates are required to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading their 1st Merit List.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates need to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration No. /Roll No.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>DOB/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code(if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After providing their details appropriately candidates will be able to check their 1st Merit List.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can also check their 1st Merit List from official site of the BNMU.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BNMU University UG Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Selection will be based on </span>Merit List.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" 